@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Login (guarda la cookie automáticamente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@demo.test",
  "password": "Demo1234!"
}

### Sesión actual
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/auth/me

### Contraseña incorrecta (debe dar 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@demo.test",
  "password": "incorrecta"
}

### Email inválido (debe dar 400 con detalle)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "no-es-un-email",
  "password": "algo"
}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/auth/logout

### Datos del restaurante (requiere sesión)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/restaurant

### Listar mesas (requiere sesión)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/tables

### ---------- CATÁLOGO ----------

### Listar categorías
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/categories

### Listar productos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/products



### ---------- API PÚBLICA v1 (Make) ----------

@apiKey = sk_test_3c2820b2dbd2e477f0af528eb829f1c1c033a2c8b312d1e5

### Productos v1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Categorías v1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Menú completo v1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Sin API Key (debe dar 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products

### API Key inválida (debe dar 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer sk_test_incorrecta